<Text x="54" y="498" fontSize="16" color="#E8EEF7" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold">100 次里，蓝点 60 次出现降雨</Text>
<Container left="54" top="528.48" width="12" height="12" backgroundColor="#5B8FD9" borderRadius="6" />
<Text x="76" y="524" fontSize="14" color="#E8EEF7" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">蓝点 = 下雨的日子 × 60</Text>
<Container left="54" top="552.48" width="12" height="12" backgroundColor="#33517E" borderRadius="6" />
<Text x="76" y="548" fontSize="14" color="#8FA3C4" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">空点 = 没下雨的日子 × 40</Text>
<Text x="32" y="610" fontSize="19" color="#E8EEF7" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold">先撤掉三个误会</Text>
<Container left="32" top="638" width="356" height="46" backgroundColor="#16294B" borderRadius="10" />
<Text x="48" y="648" fontSize="17" color="#E2574C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold">✗</Text>
<Text x="78" y="649" fontSize="16" color="#E8EEF7" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold">和时间无关</Text>
<Text x="78" y="671" fontSize="13" color="#8FA3C4" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">不是「下 60% 的时间」</Text>
<Container left="32" top="696" width="356" height="46" backgroundColor="#16294B" borderRadius="10" />
<Text x="48" y="706" fontSize="17" color="#E2574C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold">✗</Text>
<Text x="78" y="707" fontSize="16" color="#E8EEF7" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold">和面积无关</Text>
<Text x="78" y="729" fontSize="13" color="#8FA3C4" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">不是「全城 60% 地面」</Text>
<Container left="32" top="754" width="356" height="46" backgroundColor="#16294B" borderRadius="10" />
<Text x="48" y="764" fontSize="17" color="#E2574C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold">✗</Text>
<Text x="78" y="765" fontSize="16" color="#E8EEF7" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold">是可能性</Text>
<Text x="78" y="787" fontSize="13" color="#8FA3C4" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">100 次相似天气约 60 次雨</Text>
<Container left="32" top="812" width="356" height="118" backgroundColor="#1B355E" borderRadius="12" border="2 SOLID #2E5490" />
<Text x="48" y="826" fontSize="16" color="#E8EEF7" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontWeight="bold">决定带不带伞（演示阈值）</Text>
<Text x="48" y="858" fontSize="12" color="#8FA3C4" fontFamily="Inter">0</Text>
